		<link rel="alternate" href="http://forums.postgresql.fr/viewtopic.php?pid=17162#p17162"/>
		<content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>Je pense que c&#039;est ce que j&#039;avais du faire, voici le source en vb:</p><p>&#160; &#160; NomBase=&quot;Collaborateur&quot;<br />&#160; &#160; DriverODBC = &quot;PostgreSQL ANSI&quot;<br />&#160; &#160; IPServeur = &quot;192.168.3.2&quot;<br />&#160; &#160; LoginServeur = &quot;root&quot;<br />&#160; &#160; PasswordServeur = &quot;mdp&quot;<br />&#160; &#160; Set ConnexMySQL = New ADODB.Connection<br />&#160; &#160; ConnexMySQL.ConnectionString = &quot;DRIVER={&quot; &amp; DriverODBC &amp; &quot;}; SERVER=&quot; &amp; IPServeur &amp; &quot;; DATABASE=&quot; + NomBase + &quot;; UID=&quot; + LoginServeur + &quot;;PWD=&quot; + PasswordServeur + &quot;; OPTION=3&quot;<br />&#160; &#160; ConnexMySQL.Open</p>]]></content>
